                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="4" value="Functional Requirements :&lt;br&gt;1. User should be able to add, update, delete and view and expense.(CRUD)&lt;br&gt;2. User should be able to do above CRUD expense functions with a friend or a group and divide them on basis of differet strategies like Percentage, exact, equal.&lt;br&gt;3. User should be able to do the payment and record the payment where the expense can be paid by a single user or ny multiple users.&lt;br&gt;4. User should be able to see current how my much they owe and they are owed along wth previous transactions or settled up in their history.&lt;br&gt;5. User should be able to get notify for every CRUD operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Non - FRs :&lt;br&gt;1. User can get notification from differernt mediums like : Email, SMS, Push etc.&lt;br&gt;2. Correctness or money calculations&lt;br&gt;3. Transactions should be concurrent.&lt;br&gt;4. Debt simplification.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Entities and relationships :&lt;br&gt;1. user&lt;br&gt;2. groups&lt;br&gt;3. expense&lt;br&gt;4. expense manager&lt;br&gt;5. SplitStrategy&lt;br&gt;6. payment&lt;br&gt;7. notification&lt;br&gt;8. Split&lt;br&gt;9. BalanceSheet&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;user -&amp;gt; expense&lt;br&gt;expense -&amp;gt; split&lt;br&gt;group -&amp;gt; expense&lt;br&gt;group -&amp;gt; user&lt;br&gt;group -&amp;gt; balancesheet&lt;br&gt;user-&amp;gt; balancesheet&lt;br&gt;expense manager -&amp;gt; expense&lt;br&gt;expense maanger -&amp;gt; splitstrategy&lt;br&gt;user -&amp;gt; payment&lt;br&gt;expense manager -&amp;gt; notification&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Design patterns :&lt;br&gt;1. Strategy pattern for Dividing the expense and for notifications&lt;br&gt;2. Singleton for expense manager&lt;br&gt;3. Repositiory pattern for user, group and expense&lt;br&gt;4. Observer pattern for expense&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Class Diagram :&amp;nbsp;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" verte